@startuml 06-start-chat-session
title POST /api/chat/sessions - utworzenie nowej sesji czatu

actor Client as C
participant "ChatController" as Ctrl
participant "StartSessionUseCase\n(ChatService)" as CS
participant "ChatRepository" as CR
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

C -> Ctrl: POST /api/chat/sessions\nbody: {}\n(lub z anonymousId/externalId/metadata)
activate Ctrl

note over Ctrl #LightBlue: Wszystkie 3 pola opcjonalne:\nanonymousId, externalId, metadata\nPusty {} = anonimowa sesja

Ctrl -> Ctrl: toCommand(request)\n→ StartSessionCommand

Ctrl -> CS: start(command)
activate CS

note over CS #LightBlue: EndUserIdentity logika:\n- jeśli externalId → withExternal()\n- jeśli anonymousId → anonymous(id)\n- jeśli nic → anonymous() (generuje UUID v7)\n  prefiks "anon-019e..."

CS -> CS: ChatSession.startedNow(\n  id = UuidGenerator.newUuidV7(),\n  tenant = TenantContext.get(),\n  endUser, metadata, now)

CS -> CR: saveSession(session)
CR -> DB: INSERT INTO chat_sessions\n(id, tenant_id, anonymous_id, external_id,\n started_at, last_activity_at, metadata)
CR --> CS: ChatSession (saved)

CS --> Ctrl: ChatSession
deactivate CS

Ctrl -> Ctrl: ChatApiMapper.toResponse(session)\n+ Location header

Ctrl --> C: 201 Created\nLocation: /api/chat/sessions/{id}\nbody: {\n  id, anonymousId, startedAt,\n  lastActivityAt, metadata\n}
deactivate Ctrl

note over C #LightBlue: Frontend (admin /chat) trzyma\nsessionId w useState i używa\nw kolejnych POST messages.\n\nWidget zachowuje się tak samo —\nutworzona sesja żyje do zamknięcia karty.

@enduml
